<h3><u>Abal fazl</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Abbas..<br />
Abal fazl, abal fazl..(4)<br />
{Abal fazl e bawafa, alamdaar e lashkaram<br />
Mahe haashmi nasab, ameer e dilawaram}..(3)</p>

<p>1. Khuda ke dee&#39;n ka paasbaa&#39;n<br />
shuja&#39;ato ka aasmaa&#39;n<br />
jalaal tera al amaa&#39;n.. abal fazl..(2)<br />
Husainiyat ka tarjumaa&#39;n<br />
ye ghum zado&#39;n ka sayebaa&#39;n<br />
alam ba dosh e rehnumaa.. abal fazl..(2)</p>

<p>2. Ye murtaza ka gul badan<br />
weqaar e haideri chaman<br />
shuja&#39;ato ki anjuman.. abal fazl..(2)<br />
ali misaal tegh zan<br />
wohi sukhan wohi chalan<br />
ali e dashte karbala.. abal fazl..(2)</p>

<p>3. Ameer e sabr ka akhi<br />
qaraar e jaane zainabi<br />
amme sakina hai yahi.. abal fazl..(2)<br />
tujhko shahadat jo mili<br />
bhoolegi duniya na kabhi<br />
tera alam u&#39;ncha raha.. abal fazl..(2)</p>

<p>4.&nbsp; Aye noor e dil mara qamar<br />
aye roshni mara sahar<br />
ba waqt e ghum mara separ.. abal fazl..(2)<br />
tere hai sab ye behrobar<br />
tu hi duao me asar<br />
tere sabab hu bekhatar.. abal fazl..(2)</p>

<p>5. Ghulam e ibne murtaza<br />
rehan o sarwar e azaa<br />
hamara marqaz e wafa.. abal fazl..(2)<br />
dua e binte fatema<br />
jaha&#39;n alam ye jab utha<br />
falak pukara marhaba.. abal fazl..(2)</p>

<p>{Abal fazl e bawafa, alamdaar e lashkaram<br />
Mahe haashmi nasab, ameer e dilawaram}..(3)</p>
</p>